<title>DENMARK: Unibank issues 200 mln DKK Euro note.</title>
<headline>Unibank issues 200 mln DKK Euro note.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Wednesday by Danish borrower Unibank, under what it said was its Euro Note Programme.</p>
<p>BORROWER - UNIBANK.   AMOUNT - 200 MILLION DANISH CROWNS.</p>
<p>MATURITY - DECEMBER 30, 1999.    COUPON - 4.05 PERCENT UNTIL</p>
<p>DECEMBER 30, 1998, THEN 5.10 PERCENT UNTIL MATURITY.</p>
<p>ISSUE DATE - JULY 10, 1997. TYPE - CALLABLE WITH 30 DAYS NOTICE</p>
<p>UP TO DECEMBER 30 1998.</p>
<p>THE BONDS HAVE BEEN SOLD AND WILL NOT BE PUBLICLY OFFERED</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
